## TeamOS Openbox autostart
## Reference: https://github.com/BunsenLabs/bunsen-configs/blob/carbon/skel/.config/bunsen/autostart
##
## Note: programs under /etc/xdg/autostart/ are handled by XDG autostart
## (nm-applet, polkit agent, etc.). This file is for session-specific startup.

## Wallpaper (nitrogen --save to store a selection first)
nitrogen --restore &

## Compositor (picom for transparency/shadows)
picom &

## Panel
tint2 &

## Notification daemon
dunst &

## Clipboard manager
clipcatd &

## Input method
fcitx5 -d &

## Keyboard settings
xset r rate 250 25
xset b off

